Z||000009||fiero56||11-11-2000||11:24 PM||||Opening a thread to the last page would be nice. Wouldn't mind how many posts per page then.||||reg||1
Z||000010||Seanh||11-11-2000||11:36 PM||||I dont have a problem with reducing it to 25 or 30 per page. I think that might be better. I also think we need to watch our sig's. I used to just automaticly click the show sig button, but now I just do it the first post in a thread, or try to. I have friends with web tv and somtimes on large pages loaded down with tons of big picts, it stops loading them. I love having a PC, but web tv is a great solution for those who dont own one and dont want to buy one, at a reasonable price.||||reg||1
